 "html": "<style>\n  /* C2-24 - PEPL letterhead. The bands are reserved with page margins (same as Cycle 1):\n     60 mm top clears the header artwork, 34 mm bottom clears the certification footer.\n     Frappe reads this .print-format rule as the PDF page margins; the PDF button then lays\n     the official letterhead behind every page. */\n  .print-format { margin-top: 60mm; margin-bottom: 34mm; margin-left: 14mm; margin-right: 14mm; }\n  /* ...so inside the page the content must not be pushed in a second time */\n  @media print { .print-format { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; } }\n  /* on screen: an A4 sheet with the letterhead bands left empty */\n  @media screen { .print-format { margin: 20px auto !important; padding: 60mm 14mm 34mm !important; } }\n  @page { size: A4; }\n  .pepl-doc { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.35; color: #1f2937; }\n  .pepl-doc h3 { text-align: center; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0 0 10px; }\n  .pepl-doc table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }\n  .pepl-doc .meta td { padding: 1px 0; vertical-align: top; }\n  .pepl-doc .lines th, .pepl-doc .lines td { border: 1px solid #9ca3af; padding: 3px 5px; vertical-align: top; }\n  .pepl-doc .lines th { background: #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600; }\n  .pepl-doc .lines tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }\n  .pepl-doc .num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .pepl-doc .muted { color: #6b7280; }\n  .pepl-doc .stamp { text-align: center; font-weight: 700; color: #b91c1c; border: 1px solid #b91c1c; padding: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .pepl-doc .signs { margin-top: 36px; }\n  .pepl-doc .signs td { text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #6b7280; padding-top: 3px; width: 33%; }\n  .pepl-doc .signs td.gap { border: 0; width: 3%; }\n</style>\n<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><style>body{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0}</style></head>\n<body><div class=\"print-format\"><style>\n  /* C2-24 - PEPL letterhead. The bands are reserved with page margins (same as Cycle 1):\n     60 mm top clears the header artwork, 34 mm bottom clears the certification footer.\n     The PDF button lays the official letterhead behind every page. */\n  .print-format { margin-top: 60mm; margin-bottom: 34mm; margin-left: 14mm; margin-right: 14mm; }\n  @page { size: A4; }\n  .pepl-doc { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.35; color: #1f2937; }\n  .pepl-doc h3 { text-align: center; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0 0 10px; }\n  .pepl-doc table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }\n  .pepl-doc .meta td { padding: 1px 0; vertical-align: top; }\n  .pepl-doc .lines th, .pepl-doc .lines td { border: 1px solid #9ca3af; padding: 3px 5px; vertical-align: top; }\n  .pepl-doc .lines th { background: #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600; }\n  .pepl-doc .lines tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }\n  .pepl-doc .num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .pepl-doc .muted { color: #6b7280; }\n  .pepl-doc .stamp { text-align: center; font-weight: 700; color: #b91c1c; border: 1px solid #b91c1c; padding: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .pepl-doc .signs { margin-top: 36px; }\n  .pepl-doc .signs td { text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #6b7280; padding-top: 3px; width: 33%; }\n  .pepl-doc .signs td.gap { border: 0; width: 3%; }\n</style><div class=\"pepl-doc\">\n  <table class=\"meta\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"width: 60%;\">\n        <b>To</b><br>\n        <b>Shree Steel Traders</b><br>12, Strand Road<br>Kolkata 700001<br>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: right;\">\n        <b>RFQ No.</b> PUR-RFQ-2026-00011<br>\n        <b>Date</b> 01-10-2026<br><b>Material required by</b> 01-10-2026\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 6px;\"><b>Subject: Request for Quotation PUR-RFQ-2026-00011</b></p>\n  <p>Dear Mr. R. Agarwal,</p><div><p>Please supply the specified items at the best possible rates.</p></div>\n  <p>Please quote your best price for the items below, together with delivery period, payment terms, validity of the offer and freight, and confirm that a test certificate will accompany the material where applicable.</p>\n  <table class=\"lines\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width: 5%;\">#</th>\n        <th>Item and Description</th>\n        <th class=\"num\" style=\"width: 14%;\">Qty</th>\n        <th style=\"width: 15%;\">Required By</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td><b>RM-EN8-40</b> - EN8 Round Bar 40 mm<br><span class=\"muted\">EN8 Round Bar 40 mm, hot rolled, as per IS 1570</span></td>\n        <td class=\"num\">500 Kg</td>\n        <td>01-10-2026</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>2</td>\n        <td><b>RM-EN8-45</b> - EN8 Round Bar 45 mm<br><span class=\"muted\">EN8 Round Bar 45 mm, hot rolled, as per IS 1570</span></td>\n        <td class=\"num\">600 Kg</td>\n        <td>01-10-2026</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td><b>RM-EN8-50</b> - EN8 Round Bar 50 mm<br><span class=\"muted\">EN8 Round Bar 50 mm, hot rolled, as per IS 1570</span></td>\n        <td class=\"num\">700 Kg</td>\n        <td>01-10-2026</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td><b>RM-EN8-55</b> - EN8 Round Bar 55 mm<br><span class=\"muted\">EN8 Round Bar 55 mm, hot rolled, as per IS 1570</span></td>\n        <td class=\"num\">800 Kg</td>\n        <td>01-10-2026</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>5</td>\n        <td><b>RM-EN8-60</b> - EN8 Round Bar 60 mm<br><span class=\"muted\">EN8 Round Bar 60 mm, hot rolled, as per IS 1570</span></td>\n        <td class=\"num\">900 Kg</td>\n        <td>01-10-2026</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">Please quote our RFQ number in your reply.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 22px;\">Thanking you,<br>For Parasramka Engineering Pvt Ltd<br><br><br>Purchase Department</p>\n</div></div></body></html>",
